+ nesnd_land_rules:0 "无业劳动力：#v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_reform_unemployment').GetValue|%1]#!\n欠食劳动力：#v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_reform_starving').GetValue|%1]#!\n劳动力家庭生活水平：#v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_reform_sol').GetValue|1]#!\n市场接入：#v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_reform_access').GetValue|%1]#!\n\n统计范围与地方困顿判断保持一致。推进中的子项目才增加改革进度；暂停不清空已有进度。"
